alculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, January to February ran 21% of normal on the middle, and September to October ran 64%. Grid 28354 had its driest year in 1958, at 54% of normal.</p>"}
